intelight-its.com  •  info@intelight-its.com  •  (520) 795-8808  •  1941 1st Ave S, Suite 3C, Seattle, WA 98134

Re: Distribution of Intelight, Inc. Products within the State of Wyoming
Date: 5/3/2018

To whom it may concern,

I would like to confirm that AM Signal, Inc. is the exclusive provider of both Intelight hardware and
software products and all associated services to all agencies within the State of Wyoming including
but not limited to: the MAXTIME Local Controller Software Suite, the MAXVIEW Central System
Software Suite, NEMA and 2070 Style Traffic Signal Controllers, misc. software and hardware
associated with Traffic Signal and ITS Device control.
If you have any further questions regarding the distribution of Intelight products within the State of
Wyoming, or in any other agency within the region, please contact me at tom.stiles@intelight-its.com
or on my cell phone: 801.440.1174.
Regards,

Tom Stiles, P.E. PTOE
